      "paperId": "80aa5960f9b76833b3dd7bdf6c46776f71da5275",
      "title": "\u201cThe Debate\u201d between Fichte and Hegel in the Historical and Philosophical Works of I.A. Ilyin. Article One: The Rational and the Irrational in God",
      "authors": [
